    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FISH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture Amalgams using your crane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/fe3dcc34ea736a5c9c908153c192f264.poster.avif?t=1749983490\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/fe3dcc34ea736a5c9c908153c192f264.webm?t=1749983490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/fe3dcc34ea736a5c9c908153c192f264.mp4?t=1749983490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAPTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Amalgams in your ship's hold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/e91dcf9170fd30e6aafe7a3a1b2e52ed.poster.avif?t=1749983490\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/e91dcf9170fd30e6aafe7a3a1b2e52ed.webm?t=1749983490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/e91dcf9170fd30e6aafe7a3a1b2e52ed.mp4?t=1749983490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAIL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse The Installation with your fishing ship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/68c0cbfaae3472f1ae35b7890ee5d579.poster.avif?t=1749983490\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/68c0cbfaae3472f1ae35b7890ee5d579.webm?t=1749983490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/68c0cbfaae3472f1ae35b7890ee5d579.mp4?t=1749983490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious accident, a secret scientific facility is left unused and abandoned, however, there are still objects of interest inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to recover Amalgams, creatures created from a mass-manufactured microorganism that has the ability to merge multiple animal species into one, or exaggerate characteristics of existing species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amalgams are manufactured in cells isolated from each other. Due to the nature of the microorganism used, the facilities must be partially submerged in a liquid specifically created to favor its reproduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is why the installation can only be accessed by ships, so the facilities are designed for transport and circulation with maritime vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the Amalgams are created, they are captured in F-Pots, cages designed for their safe transport. These cages are kept submerged with the Amalgam inside until they emerge via activation of their associated buoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is equipped with a crane capable of transporting and activating F-Pots, you must use it to pick up the Amalgams and store them in your hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the time of the accident the Amalgams were sedated by the automatic safety system, but it cannot be ruled out that some of them are still active.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FISH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture Amalgams using your crane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/fe3dcc34ea736a5c9c908153c192f264.poster.avif?t=1749983490\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/fe3dcc34ea736a5c9c908153c192f264.webm?t=1749983490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/fe3dcc34ea736a5c9c908153c192f264.mp4?t=1749983490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAPTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Amalgams in your ship's hold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/e91dcf9170fd30e6aafe7a3a1b2e52ed.poster.avif?t=1749983490\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/e91dcf9170fd30e6aafe7a3a1b2e52ed.webm?t=1749983490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/e91dcf9170fd30e6aafe7a3a1b2e52ed.mp4?t=1749983490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAIL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse The Installation with your fishing ship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/68c0cbfaae3472f1ae35b7890ee5d579.poster.avif?t=1749983490\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/68c0cbfaae3472f1ae35b7890ee5d579.webm?t=1749983490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/68c0cbfaae3472f1ae35b7890ee5d579.mp4?t=1749983490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious accident, a secret scientific facility is left unused and abandoned, however, there are still objects of interest inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to recover Amalgams, creatures created from a mass-manufactured microorganism that has the ability to merge multiple animal species into one, or exaggerate characteristics of existing species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amalgams are manufactured in cells isolated from each other. Due to the nature of the microorganism used, the facilities must be partially submerged in a liquid specifically created to favor its reproduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is why the installation can only be accessed by ships, so the facilities are designed for transport and circulation with maritime vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the Amalgams are created, they are captured in F-Pots, cages designed for their safe transport. These cages are kept submerged with the Amalgam inside until they emerge via activation of their associated buoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is equipped with a crane capable of transporting and activating F-Pots, you must use it to pick up the Amalgams and store them in your hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the time of the accident the Amalgams were sedated by the automatic safety system, but it cannot be ruled out that some of them are still active.</p>",
